<title>USA: Lawrence, Kan., won by Prudential.</title>
<headline>Lawrence, Kan., won by Prudential.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities Inc said it won $6.900 million of Lawrence, Kan., water and sewage system revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.10 percent.</p>
</text>
